{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "85d284731db2c28fbbd03f21c1f551c101247ed529d4c749f3389baa5a3c9d79", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ、今日の公演、とっても\nよかったですよね？　私、まだ……胸がアツくて……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天的公演很精彩吧？\n我到现在……心情还是很激动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "57c89181397162bcda9a2649cd1d9bdd1008211cd5edf608966652dbca851ea3", "ja": "ああ、いい公演だったよ！　あたたかくて、\n幸せで……、みんな本当に楽しそうだったな。", "zh": "是啊，是场很棒的公演！\n既温暖，又幸福……大家看起来真的很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "0fe0e1a7c3d47fcfa0194dd2455f0ea18800918899accc231bf24489c8960414", "ja": "そうですよねっ。よかったぁ。\nそんな風に感じたのは、私だけじゃなかったんだ……。", "zh": "就是说啊！太好了～\n原来有这种感觉的不是只有我一个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "28c671c6bf59eec3820c2557d42bb1248842f991094f420c576c10310d1527b3", "ja": "劇場メンバーは今も控え室で盛り上がってるしな。今日\nは皆にとって、忘れられないライブになったと思う。", "zh": "剧场成员现在也在准备室里兴高采烈的。\n我想今天的演唱会对大家而言肯定很难忘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "080e8855cea681386ff66a0c9ee1bbaed9891a8e2c213e3fece3d1211c3c4aa9", "ja": "はい、何度も思い出しちゃうと思います！\n……実は今日、ちょっと不安だったんです。", "zh": "是啊，我一定会回想起很多次的！\n其实我今天……原本有点不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "c98763fdaa22aedb11f0b3d7414801f3fed02918c1a1dec8bd6fc0e1f0f034ec", "ja": "劇場のみんなとのステージが、どんな風になるのか\nな～って。いろんな気持ちが混ざっちゃって……。", "zh": "因为我一直在想像，和剧场的大家同台时\n究竟能做出什么样的表演，结果心情变得很复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "7d9c5ec2c3838a47c97e899ff86034ed41468f8093ac3a9d3df940cca15e17a7", "ja": "でも一緒にステージに立ったら……。\nいつの間にか、気持ちが繋がった風に感じて！", "zh": "但在和她们一起站上舞台后……\n不知不觉中就能彼此心意相通了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2cb6472eaa8dcf03c91a20d9a8b8fd14d3b8d62d91e4817d683068dc0c5afcb6", "ja": "なるほど……。もしかしたら、春香も劇場のみんなも、\n同じ気持ちだったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……或许春香和剧场的大家\n都抱着相同的心情也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "fca917bc171369e1cde473b34c960fecd49917f3a7d51a1fc83c0c29ad1803e9", "ja": "同じ気持ち……ですか？", "zh": "相同的心情……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d07f78cd89956459e8ad4e5dd216fb7dfa8dc74fa39c9d127c48b6444cc75ea6", "ja": "ああ。この前、春香たちがみんなのために、\nウェルカムパーティーを開いてくれただろ？", "zh": "是啊，之前春香你们\n不是为大家举办了欢迎派对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d01d252b8ed06a80469eb6da919ea1e2fd615b1f63b3cd717a93859bcf5b4b6e", "ja": "相手を思いやる気持ち、仲良くなりたい気持ち。\n一緒に頑張ろうっていう、優しい気持ち……。", "zh": "为对方着想的心情、希望感情变好的心情，\n以及想要一起加油的温柔心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "41ef4b409bf2951651b8c9bbd1cc38ea66387dd500de6f9312e46236b1dbcb99", "ja": "みんな、同じ気持ちだったのかもな。\nだからステージで繋がれたんだよ、きっと。", "zh": "大家的心情说不定都是一样的呢。\n所以才有办法在表演中心意相通，我想一定是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "417f9121ebc4a0ce4aca34f830713aaba8b0936c4d4a151683b0b63d2479adc0", "ja": "仲良くなりたい気持ち……。\n一緒に頑張ろうっていう、気持ち……。", "zh": "希望感情变好的心情……\n想要一起加油的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "143c3af93205381fd279f2970596bea32052210ca5dc50be493f51ace579305b", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さんっ。\n劇場のみんなは、今、控え室にいるんですよね？", "zh": "请、请问，{$P$}先生。\n剧场的大家，现在都在准备室对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "d2868aca9c681729561d9c1a335347768489a008527a287f18af35841a043d95", "ja": "私、会いたくて仕方なくなって来ちゃって……。\nえへへっ、ちょっと行ってきます！", "zh": "我现在好想见见大家……\n嘿嘿，我去一下准备室喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7588a653d06a56397ceeb5a28d6d2afe773c7b0244db1dc29c16fd98a5bfea9e", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい。きっとみんなも、\n同じ気持ちだろうからな！", "zh": "嗯，快去吧。\n因为大家的心情一定也跟你相同啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "80f66624bb63713bc5e37224cd0b8095ca0e37354fc8dcea17665dea66f50584", "ja": "はいっ。あ、あの……。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的。那、那个……\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0034_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "e94110931f2b50879c0b716b591fa3a190b0792f783a71574c9381f269cdb482", "ja": "こんなステキな、劇場をプロデュースしてくれて。\n……私、本当に幸せです♪", "zh": "多亏你培育出这么棒的一座剧场……\n我真的觉得好幸福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
